Package: librescrs-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: LibreSCRS package repository: signing key and APT source
 Installs the certificate that signs the LibreSCRS package repository and the
 APT source that names it, so LibreCelik and the rest of LibreSCRS install and
 update with apt.
 .
 The certificate is used only for this repository: the source names it in
 Signed-By, and apt does not trust it for any other.
